---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={"PiPi Word Voyage Privacy Policy - PiFl Labs"}
  description={"PiFl Labs Co., Ltd. PiPi Word Voyage app privacy policy"}
  canonical="https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"
  alternates={[{"hreflang":"en","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"ko","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"ja","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ja/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"}]}
  extraCss={["/styles.css"]}
>
<!-- Legal Header -->
    <section class="legal-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/en/" class="legal-back"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home</a>
            <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> <span class="text-gradient">PiPi Word Voyage Privacy Policy</span></h1>
            <p class="legal-date">Effective Date: July 13, 2026</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Legal Content -->
    <main class="legal-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="legal-card">
                <p>PiFl Labs Co., Ltd. ("Company", "we", "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the mobile application <strong>PiPi Word Voyage</strong> ("App"). For matters not covered here, our <a href="/en/privacy">general Privacy Policy</a> applies.</p>

                <h2>Summary</h2>
                <p><strong>PiPi Word Voyage has no accounts or login and collects no personal information that identifies you.</strong> Your game progress (islands charted, coins, streaks, word logbook, preferences) is stored only on your device. The App collects <strong>anonymized usage statistics</strong> (such as which levels are played) through Google Firebase Analytics to help us improve the game; these statistics are not linked to your identity.</p>

                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>There is no account registration and we never collect your name, email address, contacts, location, or photos. The data the App handles is:</p>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Category</th>
                            <th>Items</th>
                            <th>How it is handled</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Game progress</td>
                            <td>Islands/seas progress, coins, daily streaks, word logbook, preferences</td>
                            <td>Stored locally on device (shared_preferences); never transmitted</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Usage analytics (Firebase Analytics)</td>
                            <td>In-app events (e.g., level start/clear, hint use, daily puzzle play), approximate device information (model, OS version, language), a random app-instance identifier</td>
                            <td>Collected in anonymized form to understand how the game is played and improve it; <strong>not linked to your identity</strong> and not used for advertising</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Email inquiries (optional)</td>
                            <td>Email address, message content</td>
                            <td>Only if you contact us by email yourself</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p>Note: an advertising SDK is present in the code but is <strong>disabled</strong> in this version, so no ads are shown and no advertising identifiers are collected or used for tracking. If we enable ads in the future, we will update this policy and disclose it within the app (including the iOS App Tracking Transparency prompt).</p>

                <h2>2. Data Retention</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Local game data</strong>: kept on your device until you delete the App or clear its data.</li>
                    <li><strong>Usage analytics</strong>: retained by Firebase Analytics for up to <strong>14 months</strong>, then automatically deleted.</li>
                    <li><strong>Email inquiries</strong>: retained for <strong>3 years</strong> after the inquiry is resolved.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Sharing and Processors</h2>
                <p>We do not sell or share your data with third parties for their own purposes. Anonymized usage statistics are processed on our behalf by <strong>Google LLC (Firebase Analytics)</strong>; see <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Firebase Privacy and Security</a>. Information collected by the app stores (Apple App Store, Google Play) during distribution is governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>

                <h2>4. Permissions</h2>
                <p>The App requires no special system permissions for gameplay. Internet access is used only to transmit the anonymized usage statistics described above. If ad functionality is enabled in the future, the iOS App Tracking Transparency prompt may be added, and you will be able to decline it.</p>

                <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
                <p>The App is not directed to children under 13 and collects no personal information that identifies a user. For any questions, contact us at <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a>.</p>

                <h2>6. Security</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Minimal-collection design: no accounts, no server of our own, and no personally identifying data.</li>
                    <li>Game data is stored only on the user's device.</li>
                    <li>Analytics data is transmitted over standard encryption (HTTPS); no non-standard encryption is included.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>You may contact us at any time regarding this policy at <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a>. Deleting the App removes your local game data and stops all analytics collection.</p>

                <h3>GDPR (European Economic Area)</h3>
                <p>If you are located in the EEA, you have rights under the GDPR including access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, and objection. The usage statistics we collect are anonymized and not linked to your identity; for any questions or requests contact <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a>.</p>

                <h2>8. Contact</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Company: PiFl Labs Co., Ltd.</li>
                    <li>Email: <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a></li>
                </ul>

                <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                <p>This Privacy Policy is effective as of July 13, 2026 (revised to reflect the introduction of anonymized usage analytics; first published July 9, 2026). Any changes will be posted on this page.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
</BaseLayout>
